1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
You don't need
more event options.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:07,000
You have Meetup.
You have Eventbrite.
You have 12 open tabs.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
And you're still home
on Friday night.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Because discovery
was never the problem.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:18,500
You need a loop: Pick one thing. Go. Talk to one person.
Follow up. Repeat.

6
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:23,500
Run the loop weekly
and a social life compounds. Browse events nightly and nothing does.

7
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,500
Try the 7-day plan. Link in bio.
